{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "orchestration/an-inbound-after-a-handoff-to-a-human-asks-no-agent",
  "title": "After a handoff to a human the room is held for them: the next message asks no agent, whichever rule or default would pick one, and reaches the room's transports; an address still asks the agent it names; an agent's handoff to an agent is refused, the hold staying, and only the host's transition to an agent takes it off",
