    "§19.6",
    "§19.4",
    "§19.7.1",
    "§19.7.2"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: orchestration/state.py ConversationState.human_hold, orchestration/router.py select_agent and as_hook, orchestration/handoff.py HandoffHandler.handle. Decided on RMK-1233, answering an automated security finding: a model announced a person, and an agent answered.",
